  "head": "<title>Eurovision Games Scoring — Exact Formulas for Predictions, Quiz &amp; Duels</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The exact scoring formulas Eurovision Games uses for Top-5 and Worst-5 predictions, quiz response-time tiers, duel point math, Steal vs Double, and edge cases.\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Eurovision Games Scoring — Exact Formulas for Predictions, Quiz &amp; Duels\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The exact scoring formulas Eurovision Games uses for Top-5 and Worst-5 predictions, quiz response-time tiers, duel point math, Steal vs Double, and edge cases.\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://eurovision.games/logo.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://eurovision.games/logo.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Eurovision Games Scoring — Exact Formulas for Predictions, Quiz &amp; Duels\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"The exact scoring formulas Eurovision Games uses for Top-5 and Worst-5 predictions, quiz response-time tiers, duel point math, Steal vs Double, and edge cases.\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://eurovision.games/en/scoring\">\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\">\n<meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"el_GR\" data-ssr>\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"eurovision games scoring, eurovision points formula, eurovision prediction scoring, eurovision duel scoring\">\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z\" data-ssr>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z\" data-ssr>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://eurovision.games/en/scoring\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://eurovision.games/en/scoring\" data-ssr>\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"el\" href=\"https://eurovision.games/el/scoring\" data-ssr>\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://eurovision.games/en/scoring\" data-ssr>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" data-ssr>{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Eurovision Games — Exact Scoring Formulas\",\"description\":\"Exact scoring formulas for Eurovision Games: Top-5 and Worst-5 prediction points, quiz response-time tiers, duel point math, and Steal vs Double effects.\",\"image\":\"https://eurovision.games/logo.png\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Eurovision Games\",\"url\":\"https://eurovision.games\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Eurovision Games\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://eurovision.games/logo.png\"}},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-04-30T00:00:00Z\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://eurovision.games/en/scoring\"}}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" data-ssr>{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://eurovision.games/en\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Scoring\",\"item\":\"https://eurovision.games/en/scoring\"}]}</script>",
  "main": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/logo.png\"/><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-40 backdrop-blur-md bg-euro-deep/80 border-b border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-20 sm:h-24 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center group shrink-0\" aria-label=\"Eurovision Games — home\" href=\"/en\" data-discover=\"true\"><img src=\"/logo.png\" alt=\"eurovision.games\" width=\"866\" height=\"288\" class=\"h-16 sm:h-20 w-auto select-none drop-shadow-[0_0_18px_rgba(236,72,153,0.25)] group-hover:drop-shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(236,72,153,0.45)] transition\" draggable=\"false\"/></a><nav class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1\" aria-label=\"Primary\"><a class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm transition text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5\" href=\"/en/eurovision-night\" data-discover=\"true\">Eurovision Night</a><div class=\"relative\" data-how-popover=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm transition flex items-center gap-1 text-white bg-white/10\">How to Play<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 transition-transform \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></button></div><span class=\"ml-1 mr-1 h-5 w-px bg-white/10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><button class=\"min-w-[36px] min-h-[36px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-full active:scale-95 transition-transform\" aria-label=\"Mute sounds\" title=\"Mute sounds\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">🔊</span></button><div class=\"relative\"><button type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Change language\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 pl-1.5 pr-1 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.06] hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:border-white/25 transition cursor-pointer min-h-[34px]\"><span class=\"text-base leading-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">EN</span><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white/60 transition-transform \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"ml-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-euro-purple-light to-euro-pink text-white hover:opacity-95 transition cursor-pointer\">Create a Room</button></nav><div class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-1\"><button class=\"min-w-[36px] min-h-[36px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-full active:scale-95 transition-transform\" aria-label=\"Mute sounds\" title=\"Mute sounds\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">🔊</span></button><div class=\"relative\"><button type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Change language\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 pl-1.5 pr-1 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.06] hover:bg-white/[0.10] hover:border-white/25 transition cursor-pointer min-h-[34px]\"><span class=\"text-base leading-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">EN</span><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-white/60 transition-transform \" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg></button></div><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"site-drawer\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition cursor-pointer\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><header class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-purple/20 via-transparent to-euro-pink/15 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-12 pb-14 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-20\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"text-sm text-white/60\"><ol class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 opacity-70\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12 12 3l9 9\"></path><path d=\"M5 10v10h14V10\"></path></svg><a class=\"text-white/60 hover:text-white transition\" href=\"/en\" data-discover=\"true\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-white/30\">›</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-white/90 font-medium\" aria-current=\"page\">Scoring</span></li></ol></nav><div class=\"mt-5\"><span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider border bg-euro-gold/15 text-euro-gold border-euro-gold/30\">Scoring formulas</span></div><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white\">Eurovision Games — exact scoring formulas</h1><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg sm:text-xl text-white/75 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed\">Every action maps to a transparent point total. This page lists the exact formulas the server uses to compute Top-5 and Worst-5 predictions, quiz answers, and duel outcomes — useful if you’re strategising before the show or arguing with the host afterwards.</p></div><div class=\"border-b border-white/10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></header><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"space-y-12 lg:space-y-16 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-white/80\"><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Quiz scoring</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>Each quiz round is 10 questions, 4 options per question, 15-second timer. Points are tier-based on response time — fast and right pays the most.</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto -mx-4 sm:mx-0\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[480px] text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-left\">Response time</th><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-right\">Points (correct)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">0–3 seconds</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">12</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">3.01–7 seconds</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">8</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">7.01–15 seconds</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">4</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Wrong / timeout</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><span class=\"text-white/50\">0</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-white/70 text-[15px] [&amp;_strong]:text-white\">Maximum quiz points per round: 10 questions × 12 = <strong>120</strong>. Default night runs 3 rounds (host configurable, 1–3) for a quiz cap of <strong>360</strong> points.</p></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Top-5 prediction scoring</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>Each Top-5 pick is scored against the official combined jury + televote ranking:</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto -mx-4 sm:mx-0\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[480px] text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-left\">Result</th><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-right\">Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country at the exact position you predicted</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">50</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country in the official Top 5 but at a different position</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">20</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country outside the Top 5</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><span class=\"text-white/50\">0</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-white/70 text-[15px] [&amp;_strong]:text-white\">Maximum Top-5 points: 5 exact positions × 50 = <strong>250</strong>.</p></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Worst-5 prediction scoring</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>Symmetrical to Top-5, scored against the official bottom 5 (last-place country = position 1 in your Worst-5 list):</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto -mx-4 sm:mx-0\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[480px] text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-left\">Result</th><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-right\">Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country at the exact bottom position you predicted</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">50</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country in the official Worst 5 but at a different position</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">20</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Country outside the Worst 5</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><span class=\"text-white/50\">0</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-white/70 text-[15px] [&amp;_strong]:text-white\">Maximum Worst-5 points: <strong>250</strong>. Combined predictions cap: <strong>500</strong>.</p></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Duel scoring</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>A duel is 3 trivia questions, head-to-head. Each correct answer scores by elapsed seconds — a half-second hesitation costs you a point.</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto -mx-4 sm:mx-0\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[480px] text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-left\">Scenario</th><th class=\"py-3 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/70 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-right\">Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Correct answer at 0–1 seconds</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">11–12</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Correct answer at 5 seconds</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">7</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Correct answer at 11 seconds</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-white\">1</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Wrong / timeout (≥12s)</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><span class=\"text-white/50\">0</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-white/5 last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-left\">Win bonus (higher answer total)</td><td class=\"py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-2 text-white/85 text-right\"><strong class=\"text-euro-pink-light\">+12</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"[&amp;_strong]:text-white\">Whoever has the higher answer total wins the duel; if tied, faster total response time breaks it. The winner also pockets a flat <strong>+12</strong> duel-win bonus. Their total earned that duel is called <em>v_winner_score</em>.</p></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Steal vs Double</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>The duel winner picks one of two effects on the points they just earned:</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-euro-pink/30 bg-euro-pink/[0.05] p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">⚔️ Steal</h3><p class=\"text-white/80 text-[15px] leading-relaxed\">Take <em>v_winner_score</em> points from the loser’s banked total. Capped at what the loser actually has — you cannot take them below zero. Zero-sum swing: your gain matches their loss. Best when overtaking the leader matters more than the absolute gain.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-euro-purple-light/30 bg-euro-purple-light/[0.05] p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2\">✨ Double</h3><p class=\"text-white/80 text-[15px] leading-relaxed\">Add another <em>v_winner_score</em> to your own total. Loser keeps their points. Better when you’re already ahead and don’t want to fuel a revenge challenge — strictly better when the loser has less than <em>v_winner_score</em> banked.</p></div></div><p class=\"text-white/70 text-[15px]\">Both pay the same to you when the opponent has at least <em>v_winner_score</em> banked; if they don’t, Double pays more.</p></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Penalties and edge cases</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-white/80\"><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Quitting mid-game.</strong> <span>Player marked away. Predictions still auto-score; quiz and duel opportunities are forfeited.</span></li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Refused duel challenges.</strong> <span>Tracked per player but no point penalty. The Duelist trophy rewards participation.</span></li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Mid-duel disconnect.</strong> <span>Unanswered questions score 0; duel resolves on whoever has more points.</span></li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Cheating</strong> <span>(multi-device, AI assist): host discretion; suggested resolution is voiding affected duels and quiz rounds.</span></li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Steal cap.</strong> <span>You cannot drag the loser below zero — if they have less banked than <em>v_winner_score</em>, Steal only takes what’s there.</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-5\">Worked example</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>You finished the night with:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-white/80\"><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Quiz.</strong> <span class=\"[&amp;_strong]:text-white\">18 correct out of 30, mostly tier-2 timing → <strong>~144</strong> pts.</span></li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Predictions.</strong> <span class=\"[&amp;_strong]:text-white\">1 exact Top-5 hit (50) + 2 in-Top-5 wrong-position (40) + 1 exact Worst-5 (50) + 1 in-Worst-5 (20) = <strong>160</strong> pts.</span></li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Duels.</strong> <span class=\"[&amp;_strong]:text-white\">Won 2, both Steal — 28 pts swung your way and another 24 stolen on the second = 52 from steals + 2 × 12 win bonus = <strong>76</strong> pts net.</span></li><li><strong class=\"text-white\">Total: 380 pts.</strong> <span class=\"[&amp;_strong]:text-white\">Likely Champion contender on a normal night.</span></li></ul></div></section><aside class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-purple/30 via-euro-purple-dark/40 to-euro-pink/20 px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 sm:py-12 text-center\" role=\"complementary\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Try the math live</h2><p class=\"text-white/75 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-6\">Spin up a room and watch the points stack.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-euro-purple-light to-euro-pink text-white font-bold hover:opacity-95 transition shadow-lg shadow-euro-pink/20\" href=\"/en/?action=create\" data-discover=\"true\">✨ <!-- -->Create room</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/[0.06] border border-white/15 text-white font-bold hover:bg-white/10 transition\" href=\"/en/how-to-play\" data-discover=\"true\">How to play</a></div></aside><section aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-5\">Keep reading</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"group relative rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-euro-pink/50 hover:bg-white/[0.04] transition-all duration-200 p-5\" href=\"/en/eurovision-predictions\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white group-hover:text-euro-pink-light transition\">Predictions</h3><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white/30 group-hover:text-euro-pink-light group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform shrink-0 mt-1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M17 7H8M17 7v9\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">Top 5 and Worst 5 mechanics with this year&#x27;s country list.</p></a><a class=\"group relative rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-euro-pink/50 hover:bg-white/[0.04] transition-all duration-200 p-5\" href=\"/en/duels\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white group-hover:text-euro-pink-light transition\">Duels</h3><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white/30 group-hover:text-euro-pink-light group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform shrink-0 mt-1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M17 7H8M17 7v9\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">Steal vs Double strategy, per-pair caps, and trophy impact.</p></a><a class=\"group relative rounded-xl border border-white/10 hover:border-euro-pink/50 hover:bg-white/[0.04] transition-all duration-200 p-5\" href=\"/en/eurovision-trivia\" data-discover=\"true\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-white group-hover:text-euro-pink-light transition\">Trivia</h3><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white/30 group-hover:text-euro-pink-light group-hover:t